            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-711, Distressed Round Cabinet Knob with Beveled Edge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple yet beautiful in design, the Distressed Beveled Edge Cabinet Knob calls upon a timeless shape. It is this classic design that is so versatile. This cabinet knob would be perfect in modern and traditional homes alike. It is available in 6 finishes including distressed copper and satin nickel (pictured). The diameter is 1-3/8 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/distressed-cabinet-knob-round-rose-rk-international-bp-486\"><b>Distressed Cabinet Knob Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-711 Distressed Mushroom Knob with Ring Edge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
